flowchart TD
  A[HTTP or Worker Request] --> B[Authenticate principal]
  B --> C[Resolve trusted tenant context]
  C --> D[Authorize action and resource]
  D --> E[Set transaction-local tenant context]
  E --> F[Repository tenant filters]
  F --> G[PostgreSQL RLS and composite FKs]
  G --> H[Return only authorized rows]
  D -->|Denied| X[403/404 + security audit]
  C -->|Missing/invalid| X
